     interview is set up, how the person is questioned, how every answer is scored, and what the
     report contains. The hero's "See the demo" link lands here (#demo).
     Left: the write-up. The four chapters double as the video's chapter buttons and light up in
     step with playback. Right: the video player.
     The video is a recorded walkthrough of the real setup, interview and report screens using
     fictional sample data. No autoplay, and no sound until the visitor presses play.
     Player controls reuse the .mh-scr-* player rules in home-motion.css (no new CSS file).
     Assets: /assets/interview-demo/interview-walkthrough.mp4 and interview-walkthrough-poster.jpg -->
